WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.900
Hi, I'm Alecs from Veridyne.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.400
If identity in your company feels like a tangle,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.900
too many logins, too many tools,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
and no idea where to begin…

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.500
you're not alone.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.700
Most teams we meet don't know where to start.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.900
That's fine.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That's exactly where we come in.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.000
First, we look at what you have.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.000
Then we give you a clear plan,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.700
in plain language.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.700
Then we build it with you,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.000
on Auth0 or Okta,

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.300
step by step.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.600
No jargon.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.600
No big-bang projects.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.200
And no users locked out along the way.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.200
Identity is all we do.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.500
My job is to make it easy for you.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.400
Let's start with a conversation.
